# @aeo/eeat-scanner — environment variables
#
# This app reads NO environment variables. It takes only a URL and crawls public
# pages; there are no API keys, OAuth credentials, or paid integrations to configure.
#
# Nothing needs to be set here or in the Vercel dashboard to run or deploy the app.
# This file exists only to make that explicit. If a future change adds an
# integration (e.g. an LLM summarizer via @aeo/llm), add its variable below and
# document it in the README.
